{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast Forward\u00a0</strong>is a fast-paced, vaporwave-inspired movement shooter where style meets speed. Play as Dizzy to dash, blast, and grapple through glitchy neon worlds in time-based levels that reward precision, flow, and momentum.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you beat the clock before the system flatlines?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DEMO Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This demo contains a mega-level of our upcoming game. This level contains a multitude of various urban biomes melded together to show you what upcoming areas and mechanics the game will include. The full release of the game will have more, but shorter, levels as well as new movement mechanics and a more polished look. This mega-level will be available in the main game as well.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Slide into Action:\u00a0</strong>Defy gravity with wall-running and smooth sliding.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999720/extras/e79554ac44f8b8ed2ccdb934c7c32c9b.poster.avif?t=1757570711\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999720/extras/e79554ac44f8b8ed2ccdb934c7c32c9b.webm?t=1757570711\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999720/extras/e79554ac44f8b8ed2ccdb934c7c32c9b.mp4?t=1757570711\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gunplay in Motion:\u00a0</strong>Unload on enemies while moving at high velocity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay 